,"type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"aec32df5-cc5a-43c2-ac33-02bc8caa1cf5","displayText":"Joe Veras","occurrenceId":"557ada35-2f5e-4786-9582-a950c226dcb7"}},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"6302aca6-2203-456f-ad96-6bd2f26ee9b3","displayText":"Luis Miguel del Amargue","occurrenceId":"c76c08e1-f1e5-4314-8ca4-aad5777936be"}},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"0b2e1a39-b265-42d6-95d5-85ad930eee84","displayText":"El Cherry Scom","occurrenceId":"693fbe15-5edf-48d3-b871-ac908b5ab5ec"}},{"text":", among others, and has begun writing her own songs, working with producers and songwriters including ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"5cbc8f2b-cb68-4ebd-8006-6837be54bbe4","displayText":"Leo RD","occurrenceId":"08285900-3db4-44bd-809f-f5fdb9ea4b9b"}},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"350e5535-5229-4d49-903e-a5de047e7723","displayText":"Cromo X","occurrenceId":"4af11ad0-fb49-4d46-b5f4-c27bbb25dc61"}},{"text":". Her singles since include «Tu Dama de Hierro» (2023), «Brindo X Mi Ex» (2024) and «Te Duele Verme Bien» (2025), written with Eddie Espinal.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Legacy","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"On 5 March 2026 she appeared on «Reina de Corazones», the third volume of the «Bchta Rising» compilation series from «BCHTA Records», a collection of several bachata artists in which her song «Papi» is track two and which also includes ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"eb79ffea-c981-4328-9d60-028caa180608","displayText":"Lady Laura","occurrenceId":"f135147f-7124-42a2-b818-a1bebd4a5d6d"}},{"text":". She continues to release singles and perform in the United States, and in September 2025 gave a long interview to the YouTube channel Bacharlando.","type":"text"}]}]}'::jsonb, 'published', id, 1 FROM artists WHERE slug = 'yammy';
